      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# GenLayer Testnets\n\nOperational landing page for the **Asimov** (`asimov-phase5`) and **Bradbury** (`bradbury-phase1`) testnets. Start here, then jump to a companion dashboard.\n\n### Dashboards\n- [Validator Status](/d/gl-wall-of-shame) — who's lagging / out of sync\n- [Network Status](/d/gl-network-status) — per-network health overview\n- [Validator Profile](/d/gl-validator-profile) — drill into a single validator\n- [Validator Overview](/d/validator-overview) — GenLayer Labs fleet deep-dive\n\n_Use the directory table below to open any validator's profile directly._"
      },
      "transparent": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Asimov — reporting",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
          },
          "expr": "count(genlayer_node_info{network=\"asimov-phase5\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
